WEBVTT

c1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.420
Ten requests got through

c2
00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:02.180
a limit of five.

c3
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.340
Most people think a

c4
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.700
limit just counts

c5
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.780
requests per minute.

c6
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:07.830
Picture a bucket

c7
00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:08.890
of tokens.

c8
00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:10.370
Each request takes one.

c9
00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:12.150
Tokens drip back steadily.

c10
00:00:12.977 --> 00:00:13.467
Here is that

c11
00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:14.847
bucket, simulated.

c12
00:00:15.442 --> 00:00:16.062
It holds five

c13
00:00:16.062 --> 00:00:17.442
tokens and refills

c14
00:00:17.442 --> 00:00:18.522
three a second.

c15
00:00:18.967 --> 00:00:20.867
Sixty random requests arrive,

c16
00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:22.507
about six a second.

c17
00:00:22.652 --> 00:00:24.482
Twenty-nine get through.

c18
00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:25.942
Thirty-one are turned away.

c19
00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:27.467
The bucket itself is

c20
00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:28.707
only a few lines.

c21
00:00:29.577 --> 00:00:30.307
But how you count

c22
00:00:30.307 --> 00:00:31.447
the window matters.

c23
00:00:31.942 --> 00:00:33.202
A fixed window resets

c24
00:00:33.202 --> 00:00:34.442
on the clock.

c25
00:00:34.597 --> 00:00:35.467
Five requests just

c26
00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:36.727
before the reset,

c27
00:00:36.727 --> 00:00:37.947
five just after.

c28
00:00:38.392 --> 00:00:38.992
Two tenths of

c29
00:00:38.992 --> 00:00:39.712
a second apart,

c30
00:00:39.712 --> 00:00:41.052
and ten get through.

c31
00:00:41.052 --> 00:00:42.492
Double the limit.

c32
00:00:42.627 --> 00:00:43.957
A sliding window remembers

c33
00:00:43.957 --> 00:00:44.957
the last second,

c34
00:00:44.957 --> 00:00:45.877
so only five

c35
00:00:45.877 --> 00:00:46.797
get through.

c36
00:00:47.587 --> 00:00:48.687
Choose the algorithm for

c37
00:00:48.687 --> 00:00:49.927
the traffic you expect,

c38
00:00:49.927 --> 00:00:50.867
and test it

c39
00:00:50.867 --> 00:00:52.027
in a simulation.
